 "source": "39030d3948889beb",
 "code": "def min_eating_speed(piles: list[int], h: int) -> int:\n    def hours_at(k: int) -> int:\n        return sum((p + k - 1) // k for p in piles)\n\n    lo, hi = 1, max(piles)\n    while lo < hi:\n        mid = lo + (hi - lo) // 2\n        if hours_at(mid) <= h:\n            hi = mid        # mid works; the answer is mid or slower\n        else:\n            lo = mid + 1    # mid is too slow\n    return lo\n",
